<<declare $minigame_won = false>>
===
title: Viviana_Bully_Start
---
Viviana : Whats up with you?? 
Viviana : Dork lookin ahh
You : ??
Viviana : What? 
You : Whats up with that pimple
Viviana : wh-wha? What pimple?
Viviana : oh.. you're lying
Viviana : what was that for anyway? 
You : you mind giving it back
Viviana : giving back what? I don't even know you
Viviana : who the hell are you anyway
You : You know.. the marbles you keep telling Grace you don't have
    -> By the way, I'm Lola, the GOAT of this town
        Viviana : Lola? 
        Viviana : The goat? why are you a goat? what does that even mean..
        Viviana : Anyways..
    -> I'm Lola.. anyways what do you know about James??
        Viviana : James is the king here 
        Viviana : We are very good friends, he doesn't know that though
        Viviana : Anyways..
Viviana : What do you know??
Viviana : Speaking of marbles, if Grace wants you to be her little lapdog so bad and have you get it for her instead of herself
Viviana : How about playing this little game with me?
<<start_minigame MinigameManager "SheepGame">>
<<if $minigame_won>>
    Viviana : ...fine. You win. Here are the marbles
    <<set_phase "end">>
<<else>>
    Viviana : Ha! Come back when you're better
<<endif>>
===
title: Viviana_Bully_End
---
Viviana : What are you still doing here? You got your marbles.
