title: Grace_Victim_Start
---
Grace : *crying*
You : Whats Wrong?
Grace : Its Viviana..
You : Whos Viviana? 
Grace : Shes the kid with the paper boat hat
Grace : I keep pestering her to give me my marbles back
You : Is she not giving you marbles back? Does she not have her own..
Grace : Heres the thing, she keeps stubbornly saying that the marbles I gave her disappeared
Grace : And that, theres nothing she could do because its gone
Grace : But I keep seeing her holding the colored marbles that I gave her
You : You're sure they're yours?
Grace : Yes, they're the super limited ultra special unique KidBusters marbles  
Grace : Theres no way she would have the same marbles that I have
Grace : She even hides them when I come near, but I know she has my marbles
Grace : Can you try pestering her for me?
You : Alright.. I'll get them back for you
===
title: Grace_Victim_End
---
Grace : wait is that..
You : Yup thats it! I got your marbles back
Grace : WOAHH, oh my gosh
Grace : Are you the best? Can we be friends? How did you manage to do that??
You : Ah.. its nothing hehe
You : Lets be friends, lets take down this James guy
Grace : Ah that guy?? 
Grace : You're trying to take him down?
Grace : Alright, if its with you I'll join your side, lets beat up this James guy!!
